<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Asfalto Certo | Entender a rua para construir cidades melhores</title>
<meta name="description" content="Entenda como uma via é construída, por que ela se deteriora e como a pavimentação adequada contribui para cidades melhores.">

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Oswald:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
/* =================================================================
   ASFALTO CERTO — style.css (v2)
   Identidade: sinalização viária, camadas de pavimento, texturas
   de asfalto. Oswald (condensada, "placa de rua") + Inter (corpo).
================================================================= */

:root {
  --near-black: #071521;
  --petrol: #10283D;
  --yellow: #FFC400;
  --concrete: #F4F5F6;
  --white: #FFFFFF;
  --asphalt: #353A3F;
  --text-muted: #5C6672;

  --line: #E2E5E8;
  --shadow-soft: 0 12px 32px rgba(7, 21, 33, 0.14);
  --shadow-card: 0 4px 16px rgba(7, 21, 33, 0.08);

  --font-display: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
  --font-body: 'Inter', sans-serif;

  --max-width: 1400px;
  --radius-sm: 6px;
  --radius-md: 10px;
  --radius-lg: 18px;
  --header-h: 82px;
}

*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: var(--header-h); }
body, h1, h2, h3, h4, p, ul, ol, figure { margin: 0; }
ul, ol { padding: 0; list-style: none; }
img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }
button { font: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

body {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  color: var(--near-black);
  background: var(--white);
  line-height: 1.6;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}

h1, h2, h3, h4 {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.12;
  color: var(--near-black);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.01em;
}
h2 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 2.7vw, 2.7rem); }
h3 { font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.5vw, 1.3rem); text-transform: none; font-weight: 600; }
p { color: var(--text-muted); }

:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--yellow); outline-offset: 3px; border-radius: 4px; }
.sr-only { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); white-space: nowrap; }

.skip-link {
  position: absolute; left: -999px; top: 0;
  background: var(--yellow); color: var(--near-black);
  padding: 0.8rem 1.2rem; font-weight: 600; z-index: 1000;
  border-radius: 0 0 8px 0;
}
.skip-link:focus { left: 0; }

.container { max-width: var(--max-width); margin-inline: auto; padding-inline: 1.75rem; }

.eyebrow {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  color: var(--petrol);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}
.section-dark .eyebrow { color: var(--yellow); }

/* ============ FAIXA / LINHA TRACEJADA (motivo de sinalização) ============ */
.lane-divider {
  height: 3px;
  background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--yellow) 0 28px, transparent 28px 48px);
}
.lane-line { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; height: 4px; z-index: 2;
  background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--yellow) 0 34px, transparent 34px 60px); }

/* ============ BOTÕES ============ */
.btn {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.5rem;
  padding: 0.85rem 1.6rem; border-radius: 4px;
  font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.98rem;
  text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  border: 2px solid transparent;
  transition: transform 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease, background-color 0.18s ease, color 0.18s ease;
}
.btn-primary { background: var(--yellow); color: var(--near-black); }
.btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(255, 196, 0, 0.35); }
.btn-outline { background: transparent; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); color: var(--white); }
.section:not(.section-dark) .btn-outline,
.section-tinted .btn-outline { border-color: var(--petrol); color: var(--petrol); }
.btn-outline:hover { background: var(--petrol); color: var(--white); border-color: var(--petrol); }
.btn-text {
  background: none; border: none; padding: 0; color: var(--petrol);
  font-family: var(--font-body); text-transform: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem;
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.3rem;
}
.btn-text::after { content: '+'; font-size: 1.1rem; transition: transform 0.2s ease; }
.btn-text[aria-expanded="true"]::after { content: '–'; }

/* ============ HEADER ============ */
.site-header {
  position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 500;
  background: rgba(7, 21, 33, 0.94);
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  transition: box-shadow 0.25s ease;
}
.site-header.is-scrolled { box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); }
.header-inner { height: var(--header-h); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1.5rem; }
.brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.7rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
.brand-text { display: flex; flex-direction: column; line-height: 1.2; }
.brand-text strong { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.2rem; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: var(--white); }
.brand-text small { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); font-size: 0.7rem; }

.main-nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2.2rem; margin-left: auto; }
.main-nav ul { display: flex; gap: 1.8rem; }
.main-nav a:not(.btn) {
  font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.96rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
  position: relative; padding-bottom: 4px;
}
.main-nav a:not(.btn)::after {
  content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; bottom: 0; width: 0; height: 2px;
  background: var(--yellow); transition: width 0.2s ease;
}
.main-nav a:not(.btn):hover { color: var(--white); }
.main-nav a:not(.btn):hover::after { width: 100%; }

.menu-toggle { display: none; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 5px; width: 40px; height: 40px; background: none; border: none; }
.menu-toggle span { display: block; width: 24px; height: 2px; background: var(--white); border-radius: 2px; transition: transform 0.25s ease, opacity 0.25s ease; }
.menu-toggle[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(1) { transform: translateY(7px) rotate(45deg); }
.menu-toggle[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(2) { opacity: 0; }
.menu-toggle[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(3) { transform: translateY(-7px) rotate(-45deg); }

/* ============ HERO ============ */
.hero { position: relative; overflow: hidden; color: var(--white); }
.hero-media { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -1; }
.hero-media img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
.hero-scrim { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(7,21,33,0.55) 0%, rgba(7,21,33,0.88) 75%, var(--near-black) 100%); }

.hero-content { padding-block: 7rem 3.5rem; max-width: 900px; }
.hero-content h1 { font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 4.6vw, 4rem); color: var(--white); }
.hero-content .accent { color: var(--yellow); }
.hero-lead { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.82); font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 56ch; margin-top: 1.4rem; }
.hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 2.2rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }

.hero-indicators { position: relative; background: var(--near-black); padding-block: 2.6rem; }
.hero-indicators-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1.6rem; }
.indicator { border-left: 2px solid var(--yellow); padding-left: 1rem; }
.indicator-num { font-family: var(--font-display); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35); font-size: 0.85rem; }
.indicator h3 { color: var(--white); margin: 0.2rem 0 0.3rem; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 1rem; }
.indicator p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.62); font-size: 0.88rem; }

/* ============ SECTIONS GERAIS ============ */
.section { padding-block: 6rem; }
.section-tinted { background: var(--concrete); }
.section-dark { background: var(--near-black); color: var(--white); }
.section-dark h2, .section-dark h3 { color: var(--white); }
.section-dark p:not(.eyebrow) { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }

.section-head { max-width: 760px; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
.section-lead { font-size: 1.05rem; margin-top: 0.8rem; max-width: 64ch; }

/* ============ DA RUA À CIDADE (fluxo) ============ */
.flow-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: center; }
.flow-chain { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.flow-chain li {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;
  padding-block: 0.9rem;
  border-left: 2px dashed var(--yellow);
  padding-left: 1.4rem;
  margin-left: 8px;
}
.flow-dot { width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--petrol); margin-left: -1.55rem; flex-shrink: 0; border: 3px solid var(--white); box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--petrol); }
.flow-dot-end { background: var(--yellow); box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--yellow); }
.flow-label { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.15rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.01em; }
.flow-label-end { color: var(--petrol); font-weight: 700; }

/* ============ CROSS SECTION (camadas) ============ */
.cross-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; align-items: stretch; }
.cross-illustration {
  position: relative;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 3rem 2rem 2rem;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;
}
.cross-vehicle { position: absolute; top: 0.6rem; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); color: var(--white); }
.cross-layer {
  border: none; border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 1.4rem 1.2rem;
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--layer-color) 22%, transparent);
  border-left: 5px solid var(--layer-color);
  color: var(--white);
  text-align: left;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  transition: background 0.2s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
}
.cross-layer:hover, .cross-layer.is-active {
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--layer-color) 42%, transparent);
  transform: translateX(6px);
}
.cross-detail {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: 2rem;
  align-self: center;
}
.cross-detail h3 { color: var(--yellow); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 0.7rem; text-transform: none; }
.cross-detail p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.82); }

/* ============ SINAIS / GALERIA PROBLEMAS ============ */
.signal-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.6rem; }
.signal-card {
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  background: var(--white);
}
.signal-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); }
.signal-card img { width: 100%; height: 190px; object-fit: cover; }
.signal-body { padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem 1.6rem; }
.signal-body h3 { margin-bottom: 0.35rem; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 1.05rem; }
.signal-body > p:first-of-type { font-size: 0.92rem; margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }
.signal-cause {
  margin-top: 0.8rem; padding-top: 0.8rem;
  border-top: 1px dashed var(--line);
  font-size: 0.87rem; color: var(--near-black);
}

/* ============ COMO NASCE UM BURACO (stage) ============ */
.stage-wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; }
.stage-nav {
  flex-shrink: 0; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--line);
  display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--petrol);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
}
.stage-nav:hover { background: var(--yellow); border-color: var(--yellow); color: var(--near-black); }
.stage-track {
  display: flex; gap: 1.2rem; overflow-x: auto;
  scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
  padding-block: 0.4rem;
  scrollbar-width: thin;
}
.stage-card {
  scroll-snap-align: start;
  flex: 0 0 260px;
  background: var(--white);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-top: 4px solid var(--yellow);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: 1.6rem;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
}
.stage-num {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.6rem;
  color: var(--petrol);
  margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
}
.stage-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; text-transform: none; }
.stage-card p { font-size: 0.88rem; }
.stage-disclaimer { margin-top: 1.6rem; font-size: 0.88rem; max-width: 70ch; }

/* ============ ÁGUA + ASFALTO ============ */
.water-split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: center; }
.water-media { border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden; height: 480px; }
.water-media img { height: 100%; width: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
.water-diagram {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.9rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
  font-family: var(--font-display); text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 1.2rem;
  color: var(--white); margin: 1.4rem 0 1.6rem;
}
.water-arrow { color: var(--yellow); }
.water-note { font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 0.7rem; }
.water-tags { display: flex; gap: 0.7rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 1.8rem; }
.water-tags li {
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,196,0,0.5);
  color: var(--yellow);
  padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 0.88rem;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.water-quote {
  border-left: 3px solid var(--yellow);
  padding-left: 1.2rem;
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  font-style: italic;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
  max-width: 52ch;
}

/* ============ TAPA-BURACO X RECUPERAÇÃO ============ */
.vs-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; gap: 1.8rem; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 2.2rem; }
.vs-card img { border-radius: var(--radius-md); height: 260px; width: 100%; object-fit: cover; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.vs-card h3 { text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
.vs-card p { font-size: 0.92rem; }
.vs-divider {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 2.4rem;
  color: var(--yellow);
  -webkit-text-stroke: 1px var(--near-black);
}
.vs-question { background: var(--petrol); color: var(--white); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 2rem; }
.vs-question > p { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; max-width: 55ch; color: var(--white); }
.vs-answer { margin-top: 1.2rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); max-width: 68ch; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); padding-top: 1.2rem; }

/* ============ TIMELINE (do material à rua) ============ */
.timeline { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); gap: 1.1rem; }
.timeline li { background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-md); overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); position: relative; }
.timeline-media { height: 110px; }
.timeline-media img { height: 100%; width: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
.timeline-num { position: absolute; top: 0.6rem; right: 0.7rem; background: var(--yellow); color: var(--near-black); font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 0.85rem; padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 4px; }
.timeline h3 { padding: 0.9rem 0.9rem 0.2rem; font-size: 0.95rem; text-transform: none; }
.timeline p { padding: 0 0.9rem 1.1rem; font-size: 0.82rem; }

/* ============ DETETIVES (hotspots) ============ */
.hotspot-wrap { }
.hotspot-image { position: relative; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden; }
.hotspot-image img { width: 100%; height: auto; }
.hotspot { position: absolute; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); background: none; border: none; padding: 10px; }
.hotspot-dot {
  display: block; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--yellow);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(255,196,0,0.28);
  animation: pulse 2.2s infinite;
}
.hotspot[aria-expanded="true"] .hotspot-dot { background: var(--white); box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(255,255,255,0.3); }
@keyframes pulse { 0%,100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(255,196,0,0.28); } 50% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(255,196,0,0.12); } }

.hotspot-card {
  position: absolute; bottom: 1.2rem; left: 1.2rem; right: 1.2rem;
  max-width: 420px;
  background: var(--near-black);
  color: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: 1.3rem 1.5rem;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
  border-left: 4px solid var(--yellow);
}
.hotspot-card h4 { color: var(--yellow); font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
.hotspot-card p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); font-size: 0.9rem; }
.hotspot-close { position: absolute; top: 0.5rem; right: 0.6rem; background: none; border: none; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); font-size: 1.3rem; line-height: 1; }
.hotspot-close:hover { color: var(--white); }

.hotspot-questions { margin-top: 1.8rem; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 0.8rem; }
.hotspot-questions p {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
  border-left: 2px solid var(--yellow);
  padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
  font-size: 0.92rem;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
}
.hotspot-note { margin-top: 1.2rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); }

/* ============ ANTES E DEPOIS ============ */
.ba-slider { position: relative; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden; user-select: none; box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); }
.ba-slider img { width: 100%; height: 460px; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
.ba-after-wrap { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 50%; overflow: hidden; border-right: 2px solid var(--yellow); }
.ba-after-wrap img { width: 100%; }
.ba-after { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
.ba-tag {
  position: absolute; bottom: 1rem;
  background: rgba(7,21,33,0.75); color: var(--white);
  padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem; border-radius: 999px;
  font-family: var(--font-display); text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}
.ba-tag-before { right: 1rem; }
.ba-tag-after { left: 1rem; }
.ba-range {
  position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
  margin: 0; opacity: 0; cursor: ew-resize;
}
.ba-handle {
  position: absolute; top: 0; bottom: 0; left: 50%;
  width: 3px; background: var(--yellow);
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.ba-handle::after {
  content: '↔';
  position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  width: 38px; height: 38px;
  background: var(--yellow); color: var(--near-black);
  border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
}

/* ============ ASFALTO E DESENVOLVIMENTO ============ */
.city-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: center; }
.city-media { border-radius: 50%; overflow: hidden; aspect-ratio: 1; border: 6px solid var(--white); box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); }
.city-media img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
.city-points { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.2rem; }
.city-point { border-top: 3px solid var(--yellow); padding-top: 0.8rem; }
.city-point h3 { font-size: 1rem; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
.city-point p { font-size: 0.88rem; }

/* ============ OFICINA ============ */
.workshop-steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
.workshop-step { background: var(--concrete); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 1.4rem 1.1rem; text-align: center; }
.workshop-step .stage-num { color: var(--petrol); }
.workshop-step p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--near-black); font-weight: 500; }

.checklist h3 { margin-bottom: 1.2rem; text-transform: none; }
.checklist-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 0.8rem; }
.checklist-grid li {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem;
  font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--near-black); font-weight: 500;
  background: var(--concrete);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem;
}
.checklist-grid li::before { content: '✓'; color: var(--petrol); font-weight: 700; }

/* ============ CARDS GERAIS (canais, materiais) ============ */
.card-grid { display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; }
.card-grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
.card {
  background: var(--white);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-top: 3px solid var(--petrol);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: 1.8rem;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
}
.card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); }
.card h3 { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-size: 1.1rem; text-transform: none; }
.card p { font-size: 0.94rem; }
.resource-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.9rem; }
.resource-btn { align-self: flex-start; margin-top: 0.4rem; }

.note-box { background: var(--white); border-left: 4px solid var(--yellow); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 2.2rem; }

/* ============ FONTES ============ */
.sources-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 0.9rem 2rem; }
.sources-list li { padding-left: 1.3rem; position: relative; color: var(--near-black); font-weight: 500; }
.sources-list li::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0.55em; width: 8px; height: 8px; background: var(--yellow); border-radius: 2px; }

/* ============ ENQUETE ============ */
.poll { background: var(--near-black); color: var(--white); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 3rem; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; align-items: center; }
.poll-copy h2 { color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
.poll-copy p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }
.poll-form fieldset { border: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.7rem; margin-bottom: 1.4rem; }
.poll-option {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
  border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem; font-size: 0.92rem; cursor: pointer;
  transition: border-color 0.18s ease;
}
.poll-option:hover { border-color: var(--yellow); }
.poll-option input { accent-color: var(--yellow); }
.poll-feedback { margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--yellow); font-weight: 600; min-height: 1.2em; }

/* ============ BANNER FINAL ============ */
.final-banner { position: relative; overflow: hidden; color: var(--white); }
.final-banner img { width: 100%; height: 500px; object-fit: cover; }
.final-scrim { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(7,21,33,0.55), rgba(7,21,33,0.94)); }
.final-content { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; gap: 1.2rem; }
.final-content h2 { color: var(--white); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); }
.final-content p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); max-width: 52ch; }
.final-actions { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }

/* ============ FOOTER ============ */
.site-footer { background: var(--near-black); color: var(--white); padding-block: 3rem; border-top: 3px solid var(--yellow); }
.footer-inner { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1.5rem; }
.footer-brand strong { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.2rem; }
.footer-brand p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); font-size: 0.88rem; margin-top: 0.2rem; }
.footer-nav { display: flex; gap: 1.4rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.footer-nav a { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.78); font-size: 0.9rem; }
.footer-nav a:hover { color: var(--yellow); }
.footer-note { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); font-size: 0.8rem; }

/* ============ BACK TO TOP / TOAST ============ */
.back-to-top {
  position: fixed; right: 1.6rem; bottom: 1.6rem;
  width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--yellow); color: var(--near-black); border: none;
  display: grid; place-items: center; box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
  opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; transform: translateY(10px);
  transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease, visibility 0.2s;
  z-index: 400;
}
.back-to-top.is-visible { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; transform: translateY(0); }

.toast {
  position: fixed; left: 50%; bottom: 1.6rem; transform: translate(-50%, 20px);
  background: var(--near-black); color: var(--white);
  padding: 0.85rem 1.4rem; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;
  transition: opacity 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease; z-index: 600;
}
.toast.is-visible { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, 0); }

/* ============ REVEAL ============ */
.reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px); transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease; }
.reveal.is-visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
  .reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; }
  .hotspot-dot { animation: none; }
}

/* =================================================================
   RESPONSIVO
================================================================= */
@media (max-width: 1180px) {
  .hero-indicators-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1.8rem 1.4rem; }
  .signal-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .timeline { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  .workshop-steps { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  .checklist-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  .sources-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

@media (max-width: 980px) {
  .flow-layout, .cross-section, .water-split, .city-layout, .poll { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .cross-detail { order: -1; }
  .water-media { height: 300px; }
  .city-media { max-width: 320px; margin-inline: auto; }
  .vs-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .vs-divider { justify-self: center; }
  .hotspot-questions { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .card-grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}

@media (max-width: 860px) {
  .menu-toggle { display: flex; }
  .main-nav {
    position: fixed; inset: var(--header-h) 0 0 0;
    background: var(--near-black);
    flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 2rem 1.75rem; gap: 2rem;
    transform: translateX(100%);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    overflow-y: auto;
  }
  .main-nav.is-open { transform: translateX(0); }
  .main-nav ul { flex-direction: column; gap: 1.3rem; width: 100%; }
  .main-nav a:not(.btn) { font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .nav-cta { width: 100%; text-align: center; }

  .signal-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .timeline { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .workshop-steps { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .checklist-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .card-grid-3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .poll-form fieldset { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .hero-indicators-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

@media (max-width: 560px) {
  .section { padding-block: 3.6rem; }
  .timeline { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .workshop-steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .checklist-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .poll { padding: 1.8rem; }
  .stage-card { flex: 0 0 220px; }
}

</style>
</head>
<body>

<a class="skip-link" href="#conteudo-principal">Pular para o conteúdo</a>

<!-- ============================================= -->
<!-- HEADER -->
<!-- ============================================= -->
<header class="site-header" id="topo">
  <div class="container header-inner">
    <a href="#inicio" class="brand" aria-label="Asfalto Certo, página inicial">
      <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="38" height="38">
          <rect x="1" y="1" width="46" height="46" rx="8" fill="#10283D"/>
          <path d="M8 34 L18 14 L30 14 L40 34" stroke="#FFC400" stroke-width="4" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          <line x1="12" y1="34" x2="36" y2="34" stroke="#F4F5F6" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="4 5"/>
        </svg>
      </span>
      <span class="brand-text">
        <strong>ASFALTO CERTO</strong>
        <small>Entender a rua para construir cidades melhores</small>
      </span>
    </a>

    <button class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mainNav" aria-label="Abrir menu de navegação">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>

    <nav class="main-nav" id="mainNav" aria-label="Navegação principal">
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#inicio">Início</a></li>
        <li><a href="#da-rua-a-cidade">A rua</a></li>
        <li><a href="#problemas">Problemas</a></li>
        <li><a href="#oficina">Oficina</a></li>
        <li><a href="#materiais">Materiais</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contato">Contato</a></li>
      </ul>
      <a href="#problemas" class="btn btn-primary nav-cta">Conheça os problemas</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="conteudo-principal">

  <!-- ============================================= -->
  <!-- HERO -->
  <!-- ============================================= -->
  <section class="hero" id="inicio" aria-label="Abertura">
    <div class="hero-media">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506022332231-3647d37c1968?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=80" alt="Vista aérea de avenidas e vias asfaltadas cruzando uma cidade" loading="eager">
      <div class="hero-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="lane-line lane-line-hero" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="container hero-content">
      <h1>
        A QUALIDADE DE UMA CIDADE<br>
        TAMBÉM PASSA PELAS <span class="accent">SUAS RUAS</span>.
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">Buracos, rachaduras e alagamentos não aparecem por acaso. Entenda como uma via é construída, por que ela se deteriora e como uma pavimentação adequada contribui para cidades melhores.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#da-rua-a-cidade" class="btn btn-primary">Entenda sua rua</a>
        <a href="#problemas" class="btn btn-outline">Conheça os problemas</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-indicators">
      <div class="container hero-indicators-grid">
        <div class="indicator reveal">
          <span class="indicator-num">01</span>
          <h3>Pavimentação</h3>
          <p>Como uma rua é construída.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="indicator reveal">
          <span class="indicator-num">02</span>
          <h3>Drenagem</h3>
          <p>Por que a água importa.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="indicator reveal">
          <span class="indicator-num">03</span>
          <h3>Manutenção</h3>
          <p>Como preservar as vias.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="indicator reveal">
          <span class="indicator-num">04</span>
          <h3>Cidade</h3>
          <p>Como a infraestrutura influencia a mobilidade e o desenvolvimento.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================= -->
  <!-- DA RUA À CIDADE -->
  <!-- ============================================= -->
  <section class="section" id="da-rua-a-cidade" aria-labelledby="rua-cidade-title">
    <div class="container flow-layout">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <h2 id="rua-cidade-title">Uma rua não é apenas asfalto.</h2>
        <p class="section-lead">A qualidade das vias influencia deslocamentos, acesso aos bairros, transporte, serviços públicos e o funcionamento da cidade.</p>
      </div>

      <ol class="flow-chain reveal">
        <li><span class="flow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="flow-label">Pavimentação</span></li>
        <li><span class="flow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="flow-label">Vias em boas condições</span></li>
        <li><span class="flow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="flow-label">Melhor mobilidade</span></li>
        <li><span class="flow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="flow-label">Mais segurança</span></li>
        <li><span class="flow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="flow-label">Infraestrutura urbana</span></li>
        <li><span class="flow-dot flow-dot-end" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="flow-label flow-label-end">Desenvolvimento da cidade</span></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================= -->
  <!-- O QUE EXISTE EMBAIXO DO ASFALTO -->
  <!-- ============================================= -->
  <section class="section section-dark" id="camadas" aria-labelledby="camadas-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">RF01 · RF02</p>
        <h2 id="camadas-title">O que existe embaixo do asfalto?</h2>
        <p class="section-lead">O asfalto que enxergamos é apenas a parte superior de um sistema formado por diferentes camadas.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cross-section reveal">
        <div class="cross-illustration" role="group" aria-label="Camadas da via, passe o mouse para destacar">
          <div class="cross-vehicle" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 28" width="64" height="28"><rect x="4" y="8" width="44" height="12" rx="3" fill="#F4F5F6"/><rect x="14" y="2" width="24" height="10" rx="3" fill="#F4F5F6"/><circle cx="16" cy="22" r="5" fill="#10283D"/><circle cx="42" cy="22" r="5" fill="#10283D"/></svg>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="cross-layer" data-layer="revestimento" style="--layer-color:#FFC400;">
            <span>Revestimento asfáltico</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="cross-layer" data-layer="base" style="--layer-color:#3C6E91;">
            <span>Base</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="cross-layer" data-layer="subbase" style="--layer-color:#274A63;">
            <span>Sub-base</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="cross-layer" data-layer="subleito" style="--layer-color:#5A4732;">
            <span>Subleito / solo</span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="cross-detail" id="crossDetail" aria-live="polite">
          <h3 id="crossDetailTitle">Revestimento asfáltico</h3>
          <p id="crossDetailText">Camada de rolamento em contato direto com os veículos, responsável pela aderência e pela proteção das camadas inferiores.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================= -->
  <!-- QUANDO A RUA COMEÇA A DAR SINAIS -->
  <!-- ============================================= -->
  <section class="section" id="problemas" aria-labelledby="problemas-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">RF05</p>
        <h2 id="problemas-title">Quando a rua começa a dar sinais</h2>
        <p class="section-lead">Alguns sinais indicam que o pavimento está perdendo desempenho. Conhecer cada um ajuda a entender melhor o que está acontecendo.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="signal-grid">
        <article class="signal-card reveal">
          <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Pothole_in_Villeray,_Montr%C3%A9al.jpg?width=760" alt="Buraco em via asfaltada, em Montreal" loading="lazy">
          <div class="signal-body">
            <h3>Buraco</h3>
            <p>Depressão que rompe o revestimento, expondo camadas inferiores.</p>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-text signal-toggle" aria-expanded="false">Entender possível causa</button>
            <p class="signal-cause" hidden>Costuma surgir da combinação entre infiltração de água, tráfego intenso e fadiga do material ao longo do tempo.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="signal-card reveal">
          <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Asphalt_deterioration.jpg?width=760" alt="Superfície de asfalto com sinais de deterioração e rachaduras" loading="lazy">
          <div class="signal-body">
            <h3>Rachaduras</h3>
            <p>Fissuras que se formam na superfície e podem se aprofundar com o tempo.</p>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-text signal-toggle" aria-expanded="false">Entender possível causa</button>
            <p class="signal-cause" hidden>Variação de temperatura, fadiga do material e movimentação das camadas abaixo podem estar envolvidas.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="signal-card reveal">
          <img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/19550925/pexels-photo-19550925/free-photo-of-road-roller-on-asphalt-road.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=760" alt="Rolo compactador atuando sobre via em reparo, relacionado a deformações no pavimento" loading="lazy">
          <div class="signal-body">
            <h3>Deformação</h3>
            <p>Ondulações ou afundamentos que alteram a superfície regular da via.</p>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-text signal-toggle" aria-expanded="false">Entender possível causa</button>
            <p class="signal-cause" hidden>Pode estar relacionada a compactação inadequada, sobrecarga de tráfego ou deficiência nas camadas de base.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="signal-card reveal">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1490410695069-4affdee840f2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=760&q=80" alt="Via asfaltada molhada após chuva" loading="lazy">
          <div class="signal-body">
            <h3>Poças</h3>
            <p>Água parada sobre a via, geralmente em pontos baixos ou mal drenados.</p>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-text signal-toggle" aria-expanded="false">Entender possível causa</button>
            <p class="signal-cause" hidden>Drenagem insuficiente, deformações que retêm água ou obstrução de bueiros são causas frequentes.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="signal-card reveal">
          <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Pothole_patching.jpg?width=760" alt="Reparo (remendo) sendo aplicado em buraco no asfalto" loading="lazy">
          <div class="signal-body">
            <h3>Remendos</h3>
            <p>Áreas reparadas pontualmente, visíveis pela diferença de textura.</p>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-text signal-toggle" aria-expanded="false">Entender possível causa</button>
            <p class="signal-cause" hidden>Geralmente resultam de reparo localizado após um buraco ou de intervenção em rede subterrânea.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="signal-card reveal">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1490410695069-4affdee840f2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=760&q=80" alt="Via molhada, ilustrando dificuldade de escoamento de água" loading="lazy">
          <div class="signal-body">
            <h3>Drenagem</h3>
            <p>Falhas no direcionamento da água comprometem a durabilidade da via.</p>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-text signal-toggle" aria-expanded="false">Entender possível causa</button>
            <p class="signal-cause" hidden>Bueiros entupidos, projeto de drenagem insuficiente ou ausência de manutenção podem causar o problema.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================= -->
  <!-- COMO NASCE UM BURACO -->
  <!-- ============================================= -->
  <section class="section section-tinted" id="como-nasce-um-buraco" aria-labelledby="buraco-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <h2 id="buraco-title">Como nasce um buraco?</h2>
        <p class="section-lead">Uma sequência educativa e simplificada. Existem diferentes causas e uma avaliação técnica pode ser necessária para cada caso real.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="stage-wrap reveal">
        <button type="button" class="stage-nav stage-prev" aria-label="Etapa anterior">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20"><path d="M15 5 8 12l7 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>

        <div class="stage-track" id="stageTrack">
          <article class="stage-card">
            <span class="stage-num">1</span>
            <h3>Pavimento em condições adequadas</h3>
            <p>A via cumpre sua função com segurança e conforto.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="stage-card">
            <span class="stage-num">2</span>
            <h3>Surgimento de pequenas fissuras ou desgaste</h3>
            <p>Sinais iniciais, muitas vezes pouco perceptíveis no dia a dia.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="stage-card">
            <span class="stage-num">3</span>
            <h3>Entrada de água ou agravamento das condições</h3>
            <p>As fissuras podem permitir a entrada de água nas camadas internas.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="stage-card">
            <span class="stage-num">4</span>
            <h3>Perda de desempenho do pavimento</h3>
            <p>A estrutura passa a responder pior às cargas do tráfego.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="stage-card">
            <span class="stage-num">5</span>
            <h3>Surgimento de danos maiores</h3>
            <p>O defeito se torna visível e mais evidente na superfície.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="stage-card">
            <span class="stage-num">6</span>
            <h3>Necessidade de avaliação e manutenção</h3>
            <p>Uma intervenção técnica passa a ser recomendada.</p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <button type="button" class="stage-nav stage-next" aria-label="Próxima etapa">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20"><path d="m9 5 7 7-7 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
      <p class="stage-disclaimer reveal">Nem todo buraco surge exatamente dessa maneira. Existem diferentes causas possíveis, e uma avaliação técnica em campo pode ser necessária para identificar a origem real do problema.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================= -->
  <!-- ÁGUA + ASFALTO -->
  <!-- ============================================= -->
  <section class="section section-dark" id="agua" aria-labelledby="agua-title">
    <div class="container water-split">
      <div class="water-media reveal">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1490410695069-4affdee840f2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" alt="Via asfaltada molhada, com água sobre o pavimento" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div class="water-content reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">RF03</p>
        <h2 id="agua-title">Água + asfalto</h2>

        <div class="water-diagram">
          <span>Chuva</span>
          <span class="water-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
          <span>Escoamento</span>
          <span class="water-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
          <span>Drenagem</span>
        </div>

        <p class="water-note">Quando existem condições inadequadas, podem ocorrer:</p>
        <ul class="water-tags">
          <li>Infiltração</li>
          <li>Acúmulo de água</li>
          <li>Deterioração</li>
        </ul>

        <p class="water-quote">“A água é um dos elementos que precisam ser considerados para a durabilidade de uma via.”</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================= -->
